      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 6, 6 McDonagh Street is a 1 bedroom, 2nd floor apartment situated in the heart of Nenagh town centre. The property consists of a bright open plan living /kitchen/dining area to the front, bathroom and a double bedroom to the rear. There is a modern fitted kitchen with integrated hob and oven.\nThe property is currenty also being used as an AirBnB.There are 6 apartments in total in the building.This property would make an ideal investment as either a first time buyer home or investment opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining - 4.345w x 3.714d\nTimber floor, fitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine\n\nBedroom - 5.335w x 2.637d\nTimber floor, Built in Wardrobe\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.064w x 2.343d\nTiled, bath with electric shower, wc, whb\n\n"
